msgid "2. Booking & Payment"
msgstr "2. Buchung & Zahlung"

#: app/templates/policies/terms.html:17
msgid ""
"Reservations are confirmed upon receipt of full payment or deposit as "
"specified during booking."
msgstr ""
"Buchungen werden nach Eingang der vollständigen Zahlung oder Anzahlung wie "
"bei der Buchung angegeben bestätigt."

#: app/templates/policies/terms.html:18
msgid ""
"We accept payments via Stripe (Credit Card, PayPal, Klarna) and Bank Wire "
